1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"tea-salt-road","section":"projects","title":["茶盐古道：山海互换","Tea–Salt Road: exchanges between mountains and sea"],"date":"2025 —","status":["调研与叙事设计","Research and narrative design"],"summary":["沿着历史商贸通道，研究食物互换、地方器物与农业景观，探索“以乡为馆”的叙事路径。","Following a historic trading route to study food exchange, local objects and agricultural landscapes."],"image":"/assets/trail-research.jpg","caption":["茶盐古道相关研习图版；路线与节点包含研究提案。","Study material on the Tea–Salt Road, including proposed routes and nodes."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["2025.07 / 驻地与考察","2025.07 / Fieldwork"],"text":["《原乡社》汇报记载，2025年7月启动茶盐古道横向课题调研，开展沿线考察与新老村民访谈。","The On Home Association presentation records the start of commissioned research in July 2025, with route surveys and interviews with established and new residents."]},{"title":["古道作为叙事空间","The route as a narrative space"],"text":["研究从“山海互换”的历史出发，把古道沿线的村落、器物与本草知识纳入考察。2025研习营中的《天地·万食·千道》是相关的短期教学实践。","Research considers villages, objects and herbal knowledge along the trading route. The 2025 camp’s related group study forms one part of this wider inquiry."]},{"title":["研究与实施的边界","Research and implementation"],"text":["分布式博物馆、驿站与古道更新在资料中包含规划性内容。这里展示研究过程，不将全部方案标记为已经建成。","The distributed museum, waystations and route improvements include proposals. Their presence in research material does not establish completed construction."]}],"related":["trail-group","diverse-foods","amend-pingnan"],"sources":["milan","award","keynote","camp"]}}]
